what costs the least amount of money per unit, what's going to get the job done? And then once I would actually finally make that decision, eight hours later, not exaggerating, I would then leave, then I'd return back to the store to return it. I would go make a different decision. I would just be consumed. I couldn't function. I couldn't live my life. And it was to the point where, you know, it got worse and worse and worse through my adolescence. What's important to note is that I was hospitalized for attempts on my life. And largely that was because, of OCD, but I was diagnosed with generalized anxiety disorder, a major depressive disorder. And yes, I did and do have those, but I also had severe OCD and nobody knew it because,

