teeth. And sometimes like brushing your teeth is not that great. Like sometimes people get sensitive gums or you get like a piece of popcorn stuck between your teeth and you have to deal with that. Right. It's like a nuisance. When people get well enough with OCD that it's really better managed, they still need to do this regularly. And there will still be days where they go, oh, wow, you know, today was a tougher day. I had this in truth. of thought of harming someone. It was a lot stronger. It kind of reminded me of what it was like six months ago. And that's kind of like a brief filling that needs to be dealt with. Right. And every now and that actually, it might be even worse. You're like, wow, you know, I'm really

